| T3 Build + Manage + Scale (180 days) | $3,000 | INFERRED — top-tier strength floor (≤0.55 × singles-math $6,500 = $3,575 → $3,000); OPERATOR-VALIDATES | 13 | T1 $243 + 12×$78 + 26 wk×$12 + 10.5 h×$12 | $1,617.00 | $23.80 | $1,122.20 |
